{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.kogane.hand",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "事务所的晚饭",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.kogane.hand",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.kogane.hand",
    "idolId": "kogane",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "不用担那种心～安心交给我～！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（话说她要做什么……事务所里应该没什么像样的材料。）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "哼哼～哼哼～♪",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……好香。）",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "制作人，快好了～再等一会儿哦～",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这么快？手脚真利落啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿……这么夸我，味道也不会变的哦～",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "……好，让您久等了～！做好了ばい！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这是……",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "很厉害吧～！？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……真想不到，这是用事务所现有的东西做出来的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "んふふー♪　这种事，早饭前就搞定啦！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "来，趁热吃吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那我就不客气了。……好、好吃……真的很好吃！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "んふふー♪　对吧～？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "让我做饭的话，没人比得过我哦！",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……有这手艺，说不定能开一条新路线。料理节目、美食外景之类的。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "哦哦！那事就交给我吧～！什么工作我都能干得漂漂亮亮！",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "来，筷子要停了哦～？还有添饭，多吃点，再干一轮活！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……呼。先休息一下吧。……肚子饿了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "制作人，工作辛苦了～！",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "肚子饿了吧？那，我给你做点什么！",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不用了，随便对付一下就行，麻烦你不太好。",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "这种事不用在意啦～",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "制作人最近都没好好吃饭吧？身体垮了，我和大家都会困扰的ばい！",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那就，难得，麻烦你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "kogane",
        "text": "好～！马上做，稍等一下！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……啊！要用火的话小心点，万一引起火灾——",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
